        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >JAX ATTACKS - Evil A.I. Bots are attacking the city!  Go Get 'Em! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players step into the boots of Jax, a rogue hacker-turned-hero, battling A.I. Bots that have overrun the metropolis. Armed with his trusty gun, you will dash across the city, jump and roll your way to reclaim the streets. With fast-paced arcade shooting, it's time to save humanity from silicon extinction!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemy A.I. Bots</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cool Retro Low Poly Style</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fire</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aim</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reload</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Third Person / First Person {while Aiming}</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roll</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crouch</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controls:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Left Joystick = Move</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Right Joystick = Look</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Left Stick Click = Run</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Right Trig = Fire</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Left Trig = Aim</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Left Bmpr = Reload</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Right Bmpr = FPS while Aiming (w/ Left Trig)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A = Jump</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >B = Roll</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Y = Crouch</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also use the keyboard/mouse if needed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >** [ R ] Key on Keyboard to Reset Player if You get stuck somewhere. **</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
